          <rdf:li>Crossdressing</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>adora dresses like a man and goes by adam in the rebellion</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>catra runs a tavern and is in a loveless arranged marriage with a loyalist</rdf:li>
          <rdf:li>if you like sexy period pieces this one's for you</rdf:li>
